#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How often gather data"
msgstr "Hur ofta data ska samlas in"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Evidence will gather data periodically. If disabled, you can only view data for specific host"
msgstr ""
"Om detta är aktiverat samlar Inventeringsdata in data regelbundet. Om det är "
"inaktiverat kan du endast visa data för en viss värd."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Inaktiverad"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d hours"
msgstr "Var %d:e timme"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Varje dag"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every week"
msgstr "Varje vecka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When evidence will be started"
msgstr "När insamlingen startar"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for gather data to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the action would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr ""
"Bastiden för datainsamlingen. Om du till exempel använder ”00:00” och väljer "
"en gång per dag, startar åtgärden ungefär vid midnatt varje dag."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How many changes store in database"
msgstr "Hur många ändringar som lagras i databasen"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If data gathering is enabled,  you can specify how many history (changed) records keep for each device"
msgstr ""
"Om datainsamling är aktiverad kan du ange hur många historikposter med "
"ändringar som ska behållas för varje enhet."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Without history"
msgstr "Utan historik"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d record"
msgstr "%d post"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d records"
msgstr "%d poster"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Display information on device edit page"
msgstr "Visa information på enhetens redigeringssida"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, flowview will display evidence data on device edit page"
msgstr ""
"Om detta är aktiverat visar Flowview inventeringsdata på enhetens "
"redigeringssida."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send email on evidence information change"
msgstr "Skicka e-post när inventeringsdata ändras"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If evidence find change, send email"
msgstr "Skicka e-post om inventeringsdata hittar en ändring"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification Host IDs"
msgstr "Värd-ID:n som undantas från aviseringar"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices report hw changes too often. You can exclude these host from email notification. Insert Host IDs, comma separator"
msgstr ""
"Vissa enheter rapporterar maskinvaruändringar för ofta. Du kan undanta dessa "
"värdar från e-postaviseringar. Ange värd-ID:n, avgränsade med kommatecken."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification device templates"
msgstr "Enhetsmallar som undantas från aviseringar"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices types report hw changes too often. You can exclude these templates from email notification. Insert device templates IDs, comma separator"
msgstr ""
"Vissa enhetstyper rapporterar maskinvaruändringar för ofta. Du kan undanta "
"dessa mallar från e-postaviseringar. Ange enhetsmallarnas ID:n, avgränsade "
"med kommatecken."
